            chapo: "A live figure and a dated figure do not serve the same purpose. The first tells you the current state of a catalogue; the second has to stay true in two years, when a journalist reopens the article quoting it. Unlock My Data therefore publishes both separately: an observatory refreshed at every deployment, and studies whose data is frozen and published with its digests.",
